cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Topology change in Causal Set Theory"
abstract: >-
  Numerical demonstration that a change of spatial topology is recoverable from
  the causal order alone in 2+1 and 3+1 dimensions, together with the checks
  supporting the analytic claims of the accompanying paper on the Gauss-Bonnet
  term in causal set theory.
authors:
  - family-names: Tsilioukas
    given-names: Stylianos A.
    affiliation: "University of Thessaly; National Observatory of Athens"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/topology-change-in-causal-set-theory"
keywords:
  - causal set theory
  - topology change
  - Gauss-Bonnet
  - cosmological constant
  - quantum gravity
